flowchart TD
    Start([Payment event or follow-up review])
    OpenPayment[Admin opens payment tracking]
    SelectMember[Admin selects member]
    EnterPayment[Admin enters amount, method, status, payment date, and due date]
    Validate{Payment data valid?}
    Correct[Admin corrects payment data]
    Save[System saves payment record]
    Paid{Payment status paid?}
    UpdatePaid[System updates payment history]
    CheckDue{Due date passed and unpaid?}
    MarkOverdue[System marks payment as overdue]
    ShowUnpaid[System lists unpaid record for follow-up]
    End([Payment list and member history updated])

    Start --> OpenPayment --> SelectMember --> EnterPayment --> Validate
    Validate -- No --> Correct --> EnterPayment
    Validate -- Yes --> Save --> Paid
    Paid -- Yes --> UpdatePaid --> End
    Paid -- No --> CheckDue
    CheckDue -- Yes --> MarkOverdue --> End
    CheckDue -- No --> ShowUnpaid --> End
